\newlabel{fig:07-forward}{{2.1}{34}{A forward rate from the worked example. A two-year yield of 5\% is equivalent to earning the one-year yield of 4\% in the first year and a rate locked in today, the forward rate of 6\%, in the second}{figure.caption.10}{}}
